    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/985791076466629040eb4bec163eabfe.avif?t=1687543233\" /></div><br><br>LAVALAMP is a 3D first-person walking simulator with a side of exploration/interaction with the environment.  The game tells the story of the Space Lemmings from Space who, after running many experiments with breakfast alphabet and the space-time continuum, got blocked between dimensions (or something).<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/4ee4cb6f101a341b5b6b46be838fbc92.poster.avif?t=1687543233\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/4ee4cb6f101a341b5b6b46be838fbc92.webm?t=1687543233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/4ee4cb6f101a341b5b6b46be838fbc92.mp4?t=1687543233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>LAVALAMP is filled with : <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>cereals<br></li><li>information about the importance of eating breakfast every morning<br></li><li>epic(ish) cinematics<br></li><li>a weird storyline<br></li><li>cool colours<br></li><li>stuff that you can click on and it makes cool sounds</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/ddfca497b6cab318479931cd4a443b91.avif?t=1687543233\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/807df110c61e47c18c53d1f897b589f6.poster.avif?t=1687543233\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/807df110c61e47c18c53d1f897b589f6.webm?t=1687543233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/807df110c61e47c18c53d1f897b589f6.mp4?t=1687543233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>My name is Gabriel Ledoux, I'm a contemporary music composer and I've been developing LAVALAMP for a year. I'm a big walking simulator fan, and I've always wanted to play one with a very psychedelic feel, a lot of interaction with the environment and experimental music that would be a bit interactive. This game is the first one I've made and will release. I can't wait to show it to the world!<br><br>Since it's my first game as a solo dev, it's gonna be free. There will be no ads or informations taken from you, it's just a small weird experiment for you to play. It's gonna last somewhere between 30 and 60 minutes. I've put all my heart in this project!<br><br>I've been helped by Thomas Duret, who co-wrote the story and gave me a lot of feedback on the game. There's also Catherine C\u00f4t\u00e9-Moisescu who helped me with social medias. Voice acting is made by Sarah Albu and David E. Cronkite.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/81c53fe3153cfb2353402afb6a63e1d0.poster.avif?t=1687543233\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/81c53fe3153cfb2353402afb6a63e1d0.webm?t=1687543233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/81c53fe3153cfb2353402afb6a63e1d0.mp4?t=1687543233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game is currently under development. We are planning to launch it in Spring 2021.<br><br>Add it to your wishlist if you feel like it! It would put a lot of warmth in my heart.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/bcee4337910699dceb550ecf885d5aff.poster.avif?t=1687543233\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/bcee4337910699dceb550ecf885d5aff.webm?t=1687543233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/985791076466629040eb4bec163eabfe.avif?t=1687543233\" /></div><br><br>LAVALAMP is a 3D first-person walking simulator with a side of exploration/interaction with the environment.  The game tells the story of the Space Lemmings from Space who, after running many experiments with breakfast alphabet and the space-time continuum, got blocked between dimensions (or something).<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/4ee4cb6f101a341b5b6b46be838fbc92.poster.avif?t=1687543233\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/4ee4cb6f101a341b5b6b46be838fbc92.webm?t=1687543233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/4ee4cb6f101a341b5b6b46be838fbc92.mp4?t=1687543233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>LAVALAMP is filled with : <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>cereals<br></li><li>information about the importance of eating breakfast every morning<br></li><li>epic(ish) cinematics<br></li><li>a weird storyline<br></li><li>cool colours<br></li><li>stuff that you can click on and it makes cool sounds</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/ddfca497b6cab318479931cd4a443b91.avif?t=1687543233\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/807df110c61e47c18c53d1f897b589f6.poster.avif?t=1687543233\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461130/extras/807df110c61e47